        <p>fIOUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. TO QUARRY OWNERS, MERCHANTS, &amp;c. The Paving and Sewerage Committee of the Council of the County Borough of Warrington is prepared to receive TENDERS for 1,000 Square Yards of Concrete Flags. 1,600 Square Yards of Rawtenstall Flags, 1,000 Lineal Yards of 12in. x Sin, Dressed Kerbs, 300 Lineal Yards of 12in. x 6in. Dressed Kerbs, 1,200 Tons of 4in. x siii. Granite Setts. and 3,000 Square Yards of Lithofalt Paving Blocks: Specifications, forms of tender, and all further information may be obtained at the Office of the Borough Surveyor, Town Hall, on and after Thursday next, the 3rd December, at which place tenders must be delivered before 12 o'clock noon on Monday, the 14th of December, 1914. The lowest or any tender not necessarily accepted. ANDREW M. KER, Borough Engineer &amp; Surveyor. Borough Engineer &amp; Surveyor's Office, November 27th, 1914.</p>
